mainmenu "Robot hand pressure module"
    menu "LIMB config"
        config IMU_ENABLED
            bool "Enable IMU"
            default y
            help
                This option enables the IMU. In case the IMU isn't needed, you can turn it off using this option.
        config FORCE_REENABLE_CAN_ON_BUS_OFF
            bool "Force reenable CAN on bus off"
            default n
            help
                This option force reenables CAN if it enters a bus off state. WARNING: This might cause CAN messages
                to be starved! A bus off event means that a bunch of errors have happened, so forcing it to be reenabled
                might flood the bus with error frames.
    endmenu
